### ============================================================
### FITZONE - CONSUMO MOCK SERVER
### ============================================================
### Requiere:
###   - Extension REST Client (humao.rest-client)
###   - Mock Server de Postman activo
###
### IMPORTANTE:
###   Solo debes cambiar la URL de mock en esta variable.
###   Ningún request escribe la URL del mock directamente.
###
### Ejecución:
###   - Coloca el cursor dentro de un bloque
###   - Ctrl+Alt+R
###   - O haz clic en "Send Request"
### ============================================================

@mock_url = https://a3de0c0b-6f7e-4dac-8c93-9b00803eaef9.mock.pstmn.io

### ============================================================
### 01 - GET
### ============================================================

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 01. GET - Listar clases
### Esperado: 200 OK
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{mock_url}}/clases
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 02. GET - Obtener clase por ID
### Esperado: 200 OK
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{mock_url}}/clases/49
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 03. GET - Obtener otra clase por ID
### Esperado: 200 OK
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{mock_url}}/clases/2
Accept: application/json


### ============================================================
### 02 - POST
### ============================================================

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 04. POST - Crear clase
### Esperado: 201 Created
### ------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{mock_url}}/clases
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Clase Mock",
  "instructor": "Instructor Mock",
  "cupoMaximo": 20,
  "duracionMin": 60
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 05. POST - Crear otra clase
### Esperado: 201 Created
### ------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{mock_url}}/clases
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Clase Mock 2",
  "instructor": "Instructor Mock 2",
  "cupoMaximo": 15,
  "duracionMin": 45
}


### ============================================================
### 03 - PUT
### ============================================================

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 06. PUT - Reemplazar clase completa
### Esperado: 200 OK
### ------------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{mock_url}}/clases/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Clase Reemplazada",
  "instructor": "Instructor Actualizado",
  "cupoMaximo": 18,
  "duracionMin": 75
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 06. PUT - SIN BODY
### Esperado: 200 OK
### ------------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{mock_url}}/clases/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json



### ============================================================
### 04 - PATCH
### ============================================================

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 07. PATCH - Modificar instructor
### Esperado: 200 OK
### ------------------------------------------------------------
PATCH {{mock_url}}/clases/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "instructor": "Instructor PATCH"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 08. PATCH - Modificar cupo
### Esperado: 200 OK
### ------------------------------------------------------------
PATCH {{mock_url}}/clases/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "cupoMaximo": 25
}


### ============================================================
### 05 - DELETE
### ============================================================

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 09. DELETE - Eliminar clase
### Esperado: 204 No Content
### ------------------------------------------------------------
DELETE {{mock_url}}/clases/1
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. DELETE - Eliminar otra clase
### Esperado: 204 No Content
### ------------------------------------------------------------
DELETE {{mock_url}}/clases/2
Accept: application/json


### ============================================================
### FIN
### ============================================================
### Cobertura:
###   GET    = 3
###   POST   = 2
###   PUT    = 1
###   PATCH  = 2
###   DELETE = 2
###   TOTAL  = 10
### ============================================================
